# Shell scripts and desktop entries must reach Linux with LF endings even when
# they are edited on a Windows checkout: a CR in the shebang makes the kernel
# look for an interpreter literally named "bash\r".
*.sh text eol=lf
*.desktop text eol=lf
# Markdown is authored on Windows but read on Linux and in diffs: pinning LF
# keeps an editor that silently rewrites endings from turning a small doc edit
# into a whole-file rewrite that destroys blame.
*.md text eol=lf
